  "question": {
    "text": "If the length of the perpendicular drawn from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;on the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the image of the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> in this line, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></munderover><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
