  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let a point on the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>and the&nbsp;DR&#39;s of the line are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"&#62;\" open=\"&#60;\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/413a0384-dfd5-4368-a4b0-dfbbfd7eaf81-image.png\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p>The DR&#39;s of line joining the points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"&#62;\" open=\"&#60;\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now its perpendicular to the given line, so<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>and,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>35</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>For,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the image&nbsp;of point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
